Package: jmpinput
Title: Input Data and Indicator Estimates from the WHO/UNICEF Joint
    Monitoring Programme
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Lars", "Schöbitz", , "lschoebitz@ethz.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2196-5015"))
Description: Contains two data resources from the WHO/UNICEF Joint
    Monitoring Programme (JMP) for Water Supply, Sanitation and Hygiene.
    `jmpraw` holds the survey-level input data on sanitation that
    underlies the JMP estimates, collected from the country files
    published on <https://washdata.org>. `jmpindicators` holds the
    modelled JMP indicator estimates for water, sanitation and hygiene
    from the JMP world file. Both datasets are packaged from the JMP 2025
    release.
License: `use_mit_license()`, `use_gpl3_license()` or friends to pick a
    license
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
